{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kyHD3G5X6Z1795215234.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>原油期貨價格上升，但全個星期計，因為中東原油出口增加，連跌第三個星期。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報83.98美元一桶，升77美仙，升幅百分之0.9。倫敦期油收市報92.57美元一桶，升59美仙，升幅百分之0.6。</p><p></p><p>但全個星期計，紐約期油跌半成，倫敦期油跌百分之3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T00:09:33.881815+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T22:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:35.987892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:02:59.040065+00:00","content_hash":"1b0c407936071b1d5c8145688608a79848f32e2717bbdc640572747968d7f976","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T00:09:33.881815+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}